   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>这是<strong>标注成本最低</strong>的智能化场景：标定本来就要做，标定值天然就是真值标签。真正要花心思的是<strong>时间戳治理</strong>——三路数据频率不同（分钟级 vs 每天 1 次）、时钟不同步，对不齐就全盘皆输。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>计量数据</span><span class='cl-s'>各表读数、温压，分钟级连续</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注，需同频对齐</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>标定记录</span><span class='cl-s'>标定车/检尺的值与时间</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作为真值标签</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>维护记录</span><span class='cl-s'>清洗、检修、换表事件</span></span><span class='cl-n'>用于解释漂移突变点</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>交接协议</span><span class='cl-s'>允差条款与结算规则</span></span><span class='cl-n'>校正目标与法律边界</span></div></div>"
